==Battleground==
*100 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*100 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

